<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00501">
	<title>Warning and control</title>
	<conbody>
		<note type="tip">
			<p>The following warning messages appear on the instrument cluster:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>Keep hands on steering wheel</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Lane Following Assist Canceled</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p>For more details, refer to the warning and control section of the function.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00499.dita#t00499" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Lane Following Assist operation</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>